\par
MarkView bundles a prebuilt markdown rendering engine and theme styles derived from the following open-source projects. Each remains under its original license.\par
\par
{\b Rendering engine}\par
md-lens (MIT) \'97 Copyright (c) Hyune-s-lab\par
https://github.com/Hyune-s-lab/md-lens\par
The files index.html and runtime-*.js are build outputs of the md-lens renderer v0.4.0 with local patches (CSP base-uri, placeholder text).\par
\par
{\b Bundled runtime dependencies}\par
Marked (MIT), marked-footnote (MIT), DOMPurify (Apache-2.0), github-markdown-css (MIT), highlight.js (BSD-3-Clause), Shiki (MIT), KaTeX (MIT), Mermaid (MIT), Material Design Icons (Apache-2.0)\par
Syntax highlighting is performed by Shiki with TextMate grammars and themes from the Visual Studio Code project (MIT).\par
\par
{\b Theme styles}\par
The LaTeX and Tufte styles are original CSS written for MarkView, visually inspired by LaTeX.css (MIT, Vincent Doerig) and Tufte CSS (MIT, Dave Liepmann).\par
